<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 45pt 0.75pt 33pt; height: 11.8625px; width: 661.612px;">
<p>Welcome to Intel® Partner Marketing Studio</p>
<p></p>
<p>Action Required</p>
<p></p>
<p>This notice is to inform you that you have been registered as a representative of <span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;"> {!Account.Name} </span> by an Intel Representative.</p>
<p>An account has been generated that will allow you to access the Intel® Partner Marketing Studio web portal at <span><u><a href="https://marketingstudio.intel.com">https://marketingstudio.intel.com</a></u></span>. Please follow the instructions below to get started. </p>
<p></p>
<p>Please retain this e-mail for future reference.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #666666;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">E-mail Address:</b> </span><span style="font-family: 'Tahoma','sans-serif'; color: #0070c0;">{!Contact.Email}</span></p>
<p>Your use of the Intel® Partner Marketing Studio is subject to the terms of your company’s Trademark Licensing Agreement with Intel.</p>
<p>What you need to do</p>
<p>Please follow this <u><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/my-intel/dashboard.html">link</a></u> to complete your account set up or  copying the URL into your browser.</p>
<p>If you feel you have received this e-mail in error, please contact us <u><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/my-intel/marketing-studio-sign-in-help.html">here</a></u>.</p>
<p>Visit this <u><a href="https://www-ssl.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/my-intel/profile.html">link</a></u> any time to manage your profile.</p>
<p>Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response.<br /> To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, please add us to your address book.</p>
<p>Your use of the Intel® Partner Marketing Studio is subject to the terms of your company’s Trademark Licensing Agreement with Intel.</p>
